  "description": "Product description\n\nOUTROAD 26 Inch Mountain Bike\n\nThis 26-inch mountain bike has 21 gears and dual-disc brakes to help cyclists stay safe even in high-speed and low-slope terrain. All-terrain tires ensure adequate grip. The adjustable seat allows you to ride long distances comfortably.\n\nBICYCLE SPECIFICATIONS\n\nFull Shimano Drivetrain\n\nOutroad Mountain Bike features a full Shimano 21-speed drivetrain that provides comfortable gearing for beginners and experienced riders alike.\n\nSuspension Fork\n\nFront suspension absorbs shock from bumps and dips for a comfortable ride.\n\nExcellent Tires\n\nAnti-skid and explosion-proof materials are used. The tire pattern is wear-resistant and has a strong anti-puncture ability.\n\nMountain\n\nSweeping Road\n\nGrassland\n\nOn-Road",
